{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06159","headline":"题友人云母障子 · 王维","name":"题友人云母障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家云母障，时向野庭开。\n自有山泉入，非因采画来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}